logger.info('Processing request', { requestId: req.id });
```

### 3. 记录错误堆栈

```javascript
try {
  // 一些操作
} catch (error) {
  logger.error('Operation failed', {
    error: error.message,
    stack: error.stack,
    context: { operation: 'something' }
  });
}
```

### 4. 使用适当的日志级别

```javascript
