# Elasticsearch全文搜索

Elasticsearch是基于Lucene的分布式搜索引擎，本教程将全面讲解如何构建和优化全文搜索系统。

## Elasticsearch核心概念

### 基本架构

| 概念 | 说明 |
|------|------|
| **Cluster（集群）** | 一个或多个节点的集合 |
| **Node（节点）** | 集群中的单个服务器 |
| **Index（索引）** | 相似文档的集合 |
| **Document（文档）** | 索引中的单条记录 |
| **Field（字段）** | 文档中的属性 |
| **Mapping（映射）** | 字段类型定义 |
| **Shard（分片）** | 索引的水平拆分 |
| **Replica（副本）** | 分片的冗余备份 |

### 倒排索引

```
文档1: "Elasticsearch is powerful"
文档2: "Elasticsearch is fast"

倒排索引:
+------------+------------------+
| Term       | Documents        |
+------------+------------------+
| powerful    | [1]              |
| fast        | [2]              |
| elasticsearch| [1, 2]           |
| is          | [1, 2]           |
+------------+------------------+
```

## 索引设计

### 创建索引

```json
PUT /articles
{
  "settings": {
    "number_of_shards": 3,
    "number_of_replicas": 2,
    "analysis": {
      "analyzer": {
        "ik_max_word_synonym": {
          "type": "custom",
          "tokenizer": "ik_max_word",
          "filter": ["lowercase", "my_synonym"]
        }
      },
      "filter": {
        "my_synonym": {
          "type": "synonym",
          "synonyms": ["es, elasticsearch", "搜索,检索"]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "title": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "ik_max_word_synonym",
        "search_analyzer": "ik_smart"
      },
      "content": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "ik_max_word"
      },
      "tags": {
        "type": "keyword"
      },
      "publish_date": {
        "type": "date",
        "format": "yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss||yyyy-MM-dd||epoch_millis"
      },
      "views": {
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "location": {
        "type": "geo_point"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### 字段类型选择

| 数据类型 | ES类型 | 适用场景 |
|----------|--------|----------|
| 文本全文搜索 | text | 文章内容、描述 |
| 精确匹配 | keyword | ID、标签、状态 |
| 数字 | integer/long | 数量、金额 |
| 浮点数 | float/double | 评分、比率 |
| 日期 | date | 时间戳 |
| 布尔值 | boolean | 开关状态 |
| 地理位置 | geo_point | 坐标 |
| 对象嵌套 | nested | 对象数组 |

### 动态模板

```json
PUT /my_index
{
  "mappings": {
    "dynamic_templates": [
      {
        "strings_as_keywords": {
          "match_mapping_type": "string",
          "match": "*_id",
          "mapping": {
            "type": "keyword"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "strings_as_text": {
          "match_mapping_type": "string",
          "mapping": {
            "type": "text",
            "fields": {
              "keyword": {
                "type": "keyword",
                "ignore_above": 256
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
