```

### Tag规范

```javascript
// 使用语义化约定
span.setTag({
  'http.method': 'GET',
  'http.status_code': '200',
  'http.url': '/api/users',
  'http.route': '/api/users/:id',
  'user.id': '12345',
  'error': false
});
```

### 错误处理

```javascript
try {
  await riskyOperation();
} catch (error) {
  span.setTag({
    'error': true,
    'error.message': error.message,
    'error.stack': error.stack
  });
  span.log({ event: 'error', 'error.object': error });
} finally {
  span.finish();
}
```

