# Nginx负载均衡

Nginx是高性能的负载均衡器和反向代理，本教程将全面讲解Nginx负载均衡的配置和优化技巧。

## 负载均衡概述

### 什么是负载均衡

```
客户端
  -> 负载均衡器
    -> 服务器1
    -> 服务器2
    -> 服务器3
```

**负载均衡的核心目标**：
- 分散请求压力
- 提高系统可用性
- 实现水平扩展
- 提供故障转移

### 负载均衡类型

| 类型 | OSI层级 | 优点 | 缺点 |
|------|---------|------|------|
| **四层** | 传输层 | 性能高 | 无应用层智能 |
| **七层** | 应用层 | 功能丰富 | 性能略低 |

## 快速开始

### 基础配置

```nginx
upstream backend {
    server 192.168.1.10:8000;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000;
}

server {
    listen 80;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://backend;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
    }
}
```

## 负载均衡策略

### Round Robin（轮询）

默认策略，按顺序依次分配。

```nginx
upstream backend {
    server 192.168.1.10:8000;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000;
}
```

### Least Connections（最少连接）

将请求分配给活跃连接最少的服务器。

```nginx
upstream backend {
    least_conn;
    server 192.168.1.10:8000;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000;
}
```

### IP Hash（IP哈希）

根据客户端IP哈希值分配，同一IP总是到同一服务器。

```nginx
upstream backend {
    ip_hash;
    server 192.168.1.10:8000;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000;
}
```

### Weight（权重）

根据权重分配请求比例。

```nginx
upstream backend {
    server 192.168.1.10:8000 weight=3;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000 weight=2;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000 weight=1;
}
```

### Least Time（最少响应时间）

需要商业版Nginx Plus。

```nginx
upstream backend {
    least_time header;
    server 192.168.1.10:8000;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000;
}
```

## 健康检查

### 被动健康检查

```nginx
upstream backend {
    server 192.168.1.10:8000 max_fails=3 fail_timeout=30s;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000 max_fails=3 fail_timeout=30s;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000 max_fails=3 fail_timeout=30s;
}
```

| 参数 | 说明 |
|------|------|
| **max_fails** | 失败次数阈值 |
| **fail_timeout** | 失败后的暂停时间 |

### 主动健康检查

需要第三方模块或Nginx Plus。

```nginx
upstream backend {
    server 192.168.1.10:8000;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000;

    # 使用nginx_upstream_check_module
    check interval=3000 rise=2 fall=5 timeout=1000;
}
```

### Backup服务器

```nginx
upstream backend {
    server 192.168.1.10:8000;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000 backup;  # 仅在主服务器都不可用时使用
}
```

## 会话保持

### Sticky Cookie

```nginx
upstream backend {
    server 192.168.1.10:8000;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000;

    sticky cookie srv_id expires=1h domain=.example.com path=/;
}
```

### Sticky Learn

```nginx
upstream backend {
    server 192.168.1.10:8000;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000;

    sticky learn create=$upstream_cookie_examplecookie 
              lookup=$cookie_examplecookie 
              zone=client_sessions:1m;
}
```

## 高级配置

### 连接限制

```nginx
upstream backend {
    server 192.168.1.10:8000 max_conns=100;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000 max_conns=100;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000 max_conns=100;
}
```

### 超时配置

```nginx
upstream backend {
    server 192.168.1.10:8000;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000;
}

server {
    location / {
        proxy_pass http://backend;
        proxy_connect_timeout 5s;
        proxy_send_timeout 60s;
        proxy_read_timeout 60s;
    }
}
```

### 缓冲配置

```nginx
upstream backend {
    server 192.168.1.10:8000;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000;
    server 192.168.1.12:8000;
}

server {
    location / {
        proxy_pass http://backend;
        proxy_buffering on;
        proxy_buffer_size 4k;
        proxy_buffers 8 4k;
        proxy_busy_buffers_size 8k;
    }
}
```

## HTTP/HTTPS配置

### HTTPS后端

```nginx
upstream https_backend {
    server 192.168.1.10:443;
    server 192.168.1.11:443;
}

server {
    listen 80;

    location / {
        proxy_pass https://https_backend;
        proxy_ssl_verify on;
        proxy_ssl_trusted_certificate /etc/ssl/certs/backend-ca.crt;
    }
}
```

### SSL终止

```nginx
upstream backend {
    server 192.168.1.10:8000;
    server 192.168.1.11:8000;
}

server {
    listen 443 ssl;
    server_name example.com;

    ssl_certificate /etc/nginx/ssl/example.com.crt;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/nginx/ssl/example.com.key;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://backend;  # 后端使用HTTP
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
    }
}
```

